PROJECT GOAL
===========================================

This practical demonstrates Continuous Integration (CI) using Jenkins.
Whenever code is pushed to GitHub, Jenkins automatically:

1. Pulls the code
2. Installs required dependencies
3. Runs the ML script
4. Validates model output
5. Marks build SUCCESS or FAILURE


